-- Pages › Legal pages (design: Admin-pages, "Legal pages"): Terms, Privacy, Impressum and Cookie settings, one
-- editor for all four. Each page's `content`: body (the legal text format, @ttn/ui/lib/legalText: numbered section
-- headings, small headings, lists, links, tables), lawyerChecked, lastUpdated ("YYYY-MM-DD" or "") and autoDate (set
-- "last updated" to the day of publishing). Company details are placeholders the website fills from Site settings
-- ({company}, {address}, {email}, {phone}, {registration}; a line {registers} is the registration table) and the
-- cookie table is built from the website's code ({cookieTable}), so they are typed in one place only.
-- The rows start with the website's current text (template text: not checked by a lawyer yet).

insert into public.site_pages (slug, heading, intro, content) values
