ata may be transferred to the USA. If you prefer, contact us by email instead."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cookies and Google Maps"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "This website sets no cookies of its own. It remembers your cookie choice in your browser's storage (\"ttn-consent\", kept for 12 months), which is needed to respect that choice."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Interactive Google Maps (Google Ireland Ltd.) load only after you click to load a map or allow external media in the cookie settings (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). Google then receives your IP address and may set cookies; data may be transferred to the USA. You can change your choice at any time under Cookie settings."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "How long we keep data"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "We keep messages about a trek for as long as needed to plan it and to meet legal record-keeping duties in Nepal, then delete them. [RETENTION PERIODS]."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your rights"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "You can ask us at any time for access to your data, correction, deletion, restriction or a copy (data portability), and you can object to processing or withdraw your consent. You also have the right to complain to a data protection supervisory authority, for example the one where you live."}]}]}, "lawyerChecked": false, "lastUpdated": "", "autoDate": true}$json$::jsonb
